      "created_at": "2025-03-03T23:26:05.572Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you are using windows or Mac, you can download the font from this link <a href=\"https://cloud.erpgulf.com/files/Claudion.ttf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://cloud.erpgulf.com/files/Claudion.ttf</a></p>\n<p><strong>(⃀ U+20C0) is the code. You can add that code to a key-shortcut on Windows or mac for easy use.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>To setup up Frappe ERPNext server, please follow the below steps.</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/4/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da_2_689x138.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"GpFuoj4W8ED3QKxt35VuwmiaEO\" width=\"689\" height=\"138\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da_2_689x138.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/4/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da_2_1033x207.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/4/04cb63a17f5a3401ab57e14e3adecbde8414e8da.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1240×248 11.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><strong>cd /usr/share/fonts/</strong></p>\n<p><strong>sudo mkdir saudi</strong></p>\n<p><strong>wget <a href=\"https://cloud.erpgulf.com/files/Claudion.ttf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://cloud.erpgulf.com/files/Claudion.ttf</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>sudo fc-cache -f -v</strong></p>\n<p>You can test the font by typing following command</p>\n<p><strong>echo -e “\\u20C0”</strong></p>\n<p>You will get ⃀ as output</p>\n<p>That’s all for the installation</p>\n<p>Details <a href=\"https://cloud.erpgulf.com/blog/news/we-have-released-font-for-new-saudi-riyal-symbol-\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a></p>",
