      "name": "Zaryab Qureshi",
      "created_at": "2025-03-19T06:26:47.591Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I recently installed a font on the server, but I noticed a rendering issue on my local machine where a square appears instead of the logo. After installing the same font on my local machine, the symbol displays correctly on PDF and print format but not on general ledgers, reports and salary registers etc.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Does the font need to be installed on both the server and the client for it to work properly?</li>\n<li>Does every ERP user need to install the font on their local machine for it to display correctly?</li>\n</ul>",
