      "created_at": "2025-03-19T07:33:17.190Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Zaryabqureshi\" data-post=\"19\" data-topic=\"143400\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/a587f6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Zaryabqureshi:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>Does the font need to be installed on both the server and the client for it to work properly?</li>\n<li>Does every ERP user need to install the font on their local machine for it to display correctly?</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<ul>\n<li>Does the font need to be installed on both the server and the client for it to work properly?<br>\nYes. Install it on server for PDF rendering and other related things</li>\n<li>Does every ERP user need to install the font on their local machine for it to display correctly?<br>\nYes. Without font on client computer, it will not display on screen</li>\n</ul>",
